{"parentUuid":"ed0ab4a2-bbf7-404c-b6e0-c57075c42be9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfJUihERFWkd8pt3sSwQA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your Mac now matches GitHub. Nothing was lost.\n\n**What I did**\n- DEV root: `/Users/kristinarash/DEV`\n- Config and skills: I pulled all three repos and pushed them. Skills are synced to Codex.\n- Memory: Windows had changed two log files, `transcripts/2026-09-21.md` and `2026-09-22.md`. I kept every line from both machines.\n- I checked 146 repos:\n  - I pulled 2: `_INBOX` got 1 commit and `DataBase_GPS_Reporting` got 2.\n  - I pushed 1: `CommandCentre`, which had only a changed log file, `server.out`.\n  - I cloned 1: `TOS_Evidence_Brief`. You made it on Windows yesterday.\n  - I created no new GitHub repos. No merge conflicts happened, so there are no `.from-*` files for you to fix.\n- 22 repos are active. 117 are dormant, and all of them are clean.\n- The only change left is this session's own log in `~/.claude`. That is normal.\n\n**Result: clean.**\n\n**Also: a system warning.** The memory compiler has 2 logs it has not processed yet. Run `compile.py` by hand when you have time.\n\n**Picking up: `DataBase_GPS_Reporting`** (the active repo with the newest commit)\n- **Last session:** 2026-09-21, Mac. The 06:27 commit today is only the Windows sync.\n- **Where things stand:** The Mac owns the GPS database and pulls at 10:00 and 16:30. The last pull was yesterday at 16:32 and it worked.\n- **Blocked on:** One decision is yours. Should the Mac wake at 16:28 so the Perch and VALD pulls run on time?\n  - Option 1: set the wake with `sudo pmset repeat wakeorpoweron MTWRFSU 16:28:00`. To undo it: `sudo pmset repeat cancel`.\n  - Option 2: leave it. The data still arrives, but up to one hour late.\n  - I would pick option 1. It is one command and easy to undo.\n- **Next:**\n  - Find the job on Windows that still pulls GPS data, and stop it. Two writers make two databases that do not match.\n  - Today at 10:00, check the first pull.\n\nDo you want to continue with this, or do something else?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":695,"cache_read_input_tokens":84018,"output_tokens":806,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":24},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":695,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":806,"cache_read_input_tokens":84018,"cache_creation_input_tokens":695,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":695},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfJUigeCWjStK35E1VW45","attributionSkill":"dev-sync","type":"assistant","uuid":"3d7c781e-0e79-45b2-8aa2-e69c604114f4","timestamp":"2026-09-22T12:29:08.526Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"ecff9cb1-3f4e-4f95-becb-f41b76aa3d84","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/DataBase_GPS_Reporting","sessionId":"ecff9cb1-3f4e-4f95-becb-f41b76aa3d84","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"main"}
