{"parentUuid":"a456822f-5f73-4ea7-9103-5b35891d7bd5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"55f838da-35b9-4183-9a82-3286c8a3480f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018SGDQngv6zb8q5x9tY8pYR","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/kristinarash/.claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"56b42e30-bc47-4776-b262-aa4d505c00ee","timestamp":"2026-09-22T14:52:19.725Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/kristinarash/.claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md","oldString":"Mac owns, 10:00+16:30. Stop the Windows writer.","newString":"Mac owns, 10:00+16:30. Win writer stopped (Eric, 9/22). No 16:28 wake.","originalFile":"<!-- Cap: 2,500 chars. Working scratchpad; writes take effect next session. -->\n# Working Memory\n\n## Active Threads\n- **Prioritization slate (9/14)**: LIVE. 5 active, cap 5 (Fall). →Tier A prioritization-slate.\n- **Personal site (9/2)**: NEXT: phone check; host or local? →Tier A personal-site-build-routes.\n- **RTP CLA (9/10)**: NEXT: .ris → Zotero; lesson 0002. →Tier A rtp-cla.\n- **ATH Tech**: shipped; ITS pending; run 9/29. →Tier A tech-inventory-refresh.\n- **Status report**: #3 by 9/25, biweekly to 12/18. →Tier A supervisor-log-pipeline.\n- **GPS pull (9/21)**: Mac owns, 10:00+16:30. Stop the Windows writer. →`DataBase_GPS_Reporting/docs/`\n- **VALD+Perch (9/21)**: Mac owns. Perch 10:05+16:35; VALD 10:10+16:40. Windows jobs off. →`_INBOX/docs/`\n- **FB matchups (9/13)**: EPA = PFF; CFBD PPA cross-check. TRAP: `run_direction` != point of attack.\n- **PP Recruiting (9/16)**: 010 + 011 matrix on Drive, pushed. NEXT: Eric reviews 011. →`PP_Recruiting/docs/`\n- **Sleep scheduler (9/16)**: R1 MERGED. NEXT: night/early-kickoff itineraries. →`sleep-scheduler/docs/`\n- **RI5 #002 (9/21)**: VERIFIED + v2 PUBLISHED to Drive (28/30 ok, 2 read OK; 7 cites + \"case series\" fixed). NEXT: Eric sends `_v2` only.\n- **TypeSafe (9/21)**: router LIVE both boxes (Mac 149/149); verifier LIVE, reads printed pages. 7 measured off map (surgery notes last). NEXT: Eric Y/Ns 22 surgeries, 12-mo rule (PR #21). Rec: maintenance; #3 = Eric's call. →`TypeSafe_Sandbox/docs/`\n\n## Environment Notes\n- Hooks: patch both copies only for shared events; Codex has no prompt-submit event. →Tier A hook-two-copies-trap.\n- daily-backup: manifest entries copy nothing alone; sweep nested `~/.claude` repos and flag non-main branches. →handoff 2026-09-19-backup-divergence-fix.md\n- `DEV/Linda Projects` is a private I-983 repo. Keep private. Folder has a space; repo an underscore.\n- `~/DEV` = THIN repo; `.gitignore` starts `/*` — never remove. →Tier A github-consolidation.\n- Schedules →automation-cadence. CFB capture (Mon, 8/24–1/23) →cfb-forecast-capture. Portfolio dashboard →command-centre.\n\n## Pending Decisions\n- **OKR gate scored 9/14; still undecided**: AI integration buy-in + data governance (Anthony's proposal). Fold into NCAA charter or parking lot?\n- **Kitman vs MyLink**: MyLink (~half Kitman cost) + Kitman API access. Undecided; blocks priority 3.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":7,"newStart":7,"newLines":7,"lines":[" - **RTP CLA (9/10)**: NEXT: .ris → Zotero; lesson 0002. →Tier A rtp-cla."," - **ATH Tech**: shipped; ITS pending; run 9/29. →Tier A tech-inventory-refresh."," - **Status report**: #3 by 9/25, biweekly to 12/18. →Tier A supervisor-log-pipeline.","-- **GPS pull (9/21)**: Mac owns, 10:00+16:30. Stop the Windows writer. →`DataBase_GPS_Reporting/docs/`","+- **GPS pull (9/21)**: Mac owns, 10:00+16:30. Win writer stopped (Eric, 9/22). No 16:28 wake. →`DataBase_GPS_Reporting/docs/`"," - **VALD+Perch (9/21)**: Mac owns. Perch 10:05+16:35; VALD 10:10+16:40. Windows jobs off. →`_INBOX/docs/`"," - **FB matchups (9/13)**: EPA = PFF; CFBD PPA cross-check. TRAP: `run_direction` != point of attack."," - **PP Recruiting (9/16)**: 010 + 011 matrix on Drive, pushed. NEXT: Eric reviews 011. →`PP_Recruiting/docs/`"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a456822f-5f73-4ea7-9103-5b35891d7bd5","session_id":"ecff9cb1-3f4e-4f95-becb-f41b76aa3d84","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"ecff9cb1-3f4e-4f95-becb-f41b76aa3d84","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"main"}
