{"parentUuid":"f5e16e6e-ad30-4cfc-b697-5db52d2b456d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfJff5bzSiNNXFhc15cpM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote down both decisions and pushed them to GitHub. The Windows laptop gets them at its next sync.\n\n**What I did**\n- In `DataBase_GPS_Reporting/docs/STATUS.md`:\n  - The 16:28 wake is closed. Its entry now says you chose to leave it. Perch and VALD can land up to 1 hour late when the Mac sleeps.\n  - The Windows GPS job is marked as stopped, based on your report. I cannot check the Windows laptop from the Mac.\n- In `~/.claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md`: I updated the GPS line to match.\n\n**What to do now**\n- Nothing today. The next GPS pull runs at 10:00 by itself.\n- Change your mind about the wake only if data goes missing, not if it is just late. The command is in STATUS.md."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":464,"cache_read_input_tokens":95705,"output_tokens":277,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":464,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":277,"cache_read_input_tokens":95705,"cache_creation_input_tokens":464,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":464},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfJff4xnxuo1MCBVdaAFY","type":"assistant","uuid":"5540ca60-6d54-4e08-be88-37328bdbccfe","timestamp":"2026-09-22T14:52:29.882Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"ecff9cb1-3f4e-4f95-becb-f41b76aa3d84","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","c