{"parentUuid":"0ca09501-2bca-4344-9caa-b23fe754d2d7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfJfkBLR2Qv6T9uqVAW5e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Closeout — 2026-09-22\n\n**Committed and pushed**\n- `DataBase_GPS_Reporting`: the two decisions (no wake, Windows job stopped), and a new \"Current state\" section.\n- `graphify-out`: 13 changed files. The nightly graph job made them, not this session.\n- `~/.claude`: the backup list now includes `TOS_Evidence_Brief`. Before, the 09:05 backup reported an error because the list did not have it. The old list is saved as `~/.claude/scripts/backup-manifest.json.bak-2026-09-22`.\n- `~/.claude/global-memory`: the Windows log merge, the GPS memory line, and the removal of the fixed backup error.\n- `CommandCentre`: the `server.out` log (pushed during the sync).\n\n**STATUS.md:** I updated `~/DEV/DataBase_GPS_Reporting/docs/STATUS.md`.\n\n**Memory:** Saved. I updated `~/.claude/global-memory/MEMORY.md` and today's log exists. I also copied the docs from all 140 repos into the memory search folder.\n\n**Handoff:** Not needed. This session was a sync and two small decisions.\n\n**Other files I changed**\n- `~/.claude/scripts/backup-manifest.json`\n- `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts/.errors.log`\n- `~/.claude/global-memory/transcripts/2026-09-21.md` and `2026-09-22.md` (the merged logs)\n- `~/DEV/TOS_Evidence_Brief/` (new clone)\n\n**Still open**\n1. The memory compiler still has old logs to process. Its warning is still in `.errors.log`. A run costs about $1.28, so I did not start it. Run it when you want. The command is in `~/.claude/claude-memory-compiler/README.md`.\n\nClear to sign off. The one change I did not commit is this session's own live log in `~/.claude`. That is normal."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":343,"cache_read_input_tokens":108539,"output_tokens":677,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":21},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":343,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":677,"cache_read_input_tokens":108539,"cache_creation_input_tokens":343,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":343},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfJfkAcWVRoNsBY8y2dGi","attributionSkill":"closeout","type":"assistant","uuid":"de11e6de-fb02-40d7-8043-e56165795619","timestamp":"2026-09-22T14:53:42.328Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"ecff9cb1-3f4e-4f95-becb-f41b76aa3d84","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"ecff9cb1-3f4e-4f95-becb-f41b76aa3d84","version":"2.1.278","gitBranch":"main"}
